WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.105
- I give up. (laughs)

00:00:07.105 --> 00:00:08.243
Way too difficult.

00:00:08.243 --> 00:00:10.657
I just stood there next to her

00:00:10.657 --> 00:00:11.993
and I couldn't do anything.

00:00:11.993 --> 00:00:13.931
I couldn't even speak to her.

00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:14.764
Oh my god, Eric!

00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:15.886
Come on!

00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:16.901
Hey guys, I'm Eric.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:17.734
I recently moved to New York,

00:00:17.734 --> 00:00:20.060
and it's a little hard
to make friends here.

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:21.833
Everyone's always in a rush.

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.513
People are hard to talk to.

00:00:23.513 --> 00:00:24.346
I don't know.

00:00:24.346 --> 00:00:25.669
I feel like I'm, maybe it's my fault.

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:26.779
I feel like I'm intruding

00:00:26.779 --> 00:00:30.550
or like I don't know what
to talk to people about.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:31.843
I just don't feel like I'm
connecting with anyone,

00:00:31.843 --> 00:00:34.361
so I'm just gonna break my wall,

00:00:34.361 --> 00:00:35.722
and I'm gonna try to
make more friends today

00:00:35.722 --> 00:00:37.435
by talking to 100 strangers.

00:00:37.435 --> 00:00:40.541
Huh, this is so scary, okay.

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:41.374
Eric,

00:00:42.679 --> 00:00:44.670
you can just talk to people.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:45.702
How's it going, man?

00:00:45.702 --> 00:00:47.585
Hey man, how's it going?

00:00:47.585 --> 00:00:50.000
Is it cool if I sit here?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.245
Oh, cool man.

00:00:51.245 --> 00:00:53.430
I'm just trying to meet people.

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:54.680
You play chess?

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:57.017
You don't, no?

00:00:58.483 --> 00:00:59.316
Quiet lunch?

00:00:59.316 --> 00:01:00.248
Alright, dude. It's good, it's good.

00:01:00.248 --> 00:01:02.498
I'm Eric. Nice to meet you.

00:01:04.432 --> 00:01:06.213
Don't talk when people are eating?

00:01:06.213 --> 00:01:07.624
Okay, okay.

00:01:07.624 --> 00:01:09.046
I'm sorry. Nice to meet you, though.

00:01:09.046 --> 00:01:10.337
Who do I talk to, man?

00:01:10.337 --> 00:01:12.199
I don't think anybody wants to talk to me.

00:01:12.199 --> 00:01:13.381
Hey guys, what's up?

00:01:13.381 --> 00:01:15.256
Are you guys from here?

00:01:15.256 --> 00:01:16.857
Yeah? I'm new.

00:01:16.857 --> 00:01:18.186
I'm sorry to make this awkward.

00:01:18.186 --> 00:01:19.462
I've been here like two months.

00:01:19.462 --> 00:01:20.680
Trying to make friends.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.942
So I'm literally just going to the park

00:01:21.942 --> 00:01:24.392
and, like, talking to people.

00:01:24.392 --> 00:01:25.999
It's really awkward.

00:01:25.999 --> 00:01:27.307
Yeah, really?

00:01:27.307 --> 00:01:28.140
Awe, you guys are the best.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.223
Alright, I'm gonna do it.

00:01:32.530 --> 00:01:34.859
Eric, nice to meet you.

00:01:34.859 --> 00:01:36.677
I moved from Philly.

00:01:36.677 --> 00:01:37.856
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:37.856 --> 00:01:40.340
Is it cool if I sit down?

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.412
Perfect.

00:01:41.412 --> 00:01:43.162
What are you reading?

00:01:44.532 --> 00:01:46.032
What's that about?

00:01:50.882 --> 00:01:51.939
Are you guys-

00:01:51.939 --> 00:01:53.578
Yeah, sure.

00:01:53.578 --> 00:01:55.948
Where are you guys from, Israel?

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:57.786
No way. I just went on Birthright.

00:01:57.786 --> 00:02:00.023
Is it cool if I watch?

00:02:00.023 --> 00:02:01.321
Oh, dude, thank you guys.

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:02.821
Can I hear a poem?

00:02:03.871 --> 00:02:04.704
Yeah, man.

00:02:04.704 --> 00:02:07.287
How did you get in to juggling?

00:02:10.815 --> 00:02:12.656
Where do you go to school?

00:02:12.656 --> 00:02:14.379
Oh, that's awesome.

00:02:14.379 --> 00:02:15.462
Design stuff?

00:02:16.512 --> 00:02:17.880
That's crazy.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:21.630
I don't think I've ever
met a butcher before.

00:02:22.605 --> 00:02:23.438
Whoa.

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:27.856
Jesus. Oh my god.

00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:29.606
You're smart as hell.

00:02:37.589 --> 00:02:39.853
I'd love to sometime, maybe
take a lesson or something.

00:02:39.853 --> 00:02:41.889
Do you guys have cards?

00:02:41.889 --> 00:02:43.219
Or just, I'll find you.

00:02:43.219 --> 00:02:44.342
Yeah, let me get your number.

00:02:44.342 --> 00:02:46.959
How did you decide to
just start like this,

00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:49.709
like writing poems on the street?

00:02:52.368 --> 00:02:53.535
No I have not.

00:02:57.584 --> 00:02:58.417
Yeah.

00:03:09.351 --> 00:03:10.952
Dude, this is gettin' easy.

00:03:10.952 --> 00:03:12.173
I'm getting good at this.

00:03:12.173 --> 00:03:14.379
The next few hours were incredible.

00:03:14.379 --> 00:03:16.111
I met so many interesting people

00:03:16.111 --> 00:03:18.454
and I hope this video
can lessen the stigma

00:03:18.454 --> 00:03:20.318
behind talking to strangers

00:03:20.318 --> 00:03:22.845
because it truly is eye-opening.

00:03:22.845 --> 00:03:24.997
I mean, strangers fed me a bagel, okay?

00:03:24.997 --> 00:03:28.523
And there was just so much
positive energy and joy.

00:03:28.523 --> 00:03:30.719
Everyone was laughing, having a good time,

00:03:30.719 --> 00:03:33.287
and I ended up adding
100 people on Instagram,

00:03:33.287 --> 00:03:35.368
who I genuinely want
to stay in touch with.

00:03:35.368 --> 00:03:36.341
I know this is getting cheesy,

00:03:36.341 --> 00:03:38.657
but I experienced something awesome,

00:03:38.657 --> 00:03:40.309
and I hope everyone can see how much love

00:03:40.309 --> 00:03:41.797
this world has to offer.

00:03:41.797 --> 00:03:43.221
I just feel like I'm in
love with strangers now.

00:03:43.221 --> 00:03:44.940
I just want to talk to
strangers all the time.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:47.489
Just like, how's it going man?

00:03:47.489 --> 00:03:49.322
Yay! Good, good, good.

